[00:01.56]1. Today, Jehovah God,
[00:05.48]we stand before your throne,
[00:10.90]For you showed the greatest love
[00:14.92]that could ever be shown.
[00:21.56]You gave the gift of your dear Son,
[00:27.34]that we might live.
[00:30.80]No greater sacrifice than this
[00:35.58]could you ever give.
[00:39.32](Chorus)
[00:39.84]He gave his life to set us free.
[00:45.32]His precious blood provides the key.
[00:51.72]With all our hearts,
[00:53.68]we’ll go on thanking you eternally.
[01:02.14]2. It was a willing sacrifice
[01:08.32]that Jesus made.
[01:12.50]Out of love, his perfect life
[01:16.54]was the price that he paid.
[01:22.64]We had no hope until he came
[01:28.92]to save mankind.
[01:32.44]But now our hope is finding life,
[01:36.90]leaving death behind.
[01:40.90](Chorus)
[01:41.32]He gave his life to set us free.
[01:46.74]His precious blood provides the key.
[01:53.18]With all our hearts,
[01:55.12]we’ll go on thanking you eternally.
